Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:59:52 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Emergency (SOS) groundwork: EIMS PDN, emergency REGISTER,
 test hooks

SipHandler(emergency=true) uses the EIMS PDN and its P-CSCF, registers with the 'sos' Contact
parameter (TS 24.229 5.1.6.2), skips the reg-event SUBSCRIBE and never reports registration to
Android; adds register(expires), deregister() and shutdown(). EmergencyTestReceiver (DUMP-protected)
runs step=pdn / step=register without ever placing a call. Verified on Telstra: EIMS PDN up with
emergency P-CSCFs, emergency REGISTER 200 OK (expires=300), de-REGISTER sent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
